      "bounded nonce search returns existing placeholder DATA without candidate work for declared zero difficulty",
      "bounded nonce search produces the first explicit cursor at difficulty one and discloses bounded production",
      "bounded nonce search matches an independent finite LE64 prefix across safe declared difficulties and cursors",
